---
title: "generation_role_manage (Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: check authenticated session
    q_auth --> q_error_unauth: session invalid
    q_auth --> q_check_admin: session valid
    q_check_admin --> q_error_forbidden: user is not admin
    q_check_admin --> q_validate: user is admin
    q_validate --> q_check_input: validate generation_number and discord_role_id
    q_check_input --> q_error_validation: invalid input
    q_check_input --> q_upsert: input valid
    q_upsert --> q_sync: upsert generation-role mapping via SQL
    q_sync --> [*]: trigger Discord role sync for affected members, return success
    q_error_unauth --> [*]: return unauthorized error
    q_error_forbidden --> [*]: return forbidden error
    q_error_validation --> [*]: return validation error

    note right of q_check_admin
        INV-001: Only admin users can manage generation-role mappings
    end note

    note right of q_upsert
        INV-002: Each generation number maps to exactly one Discord role ID
        INV-003: Role assignment must be synced to Discord after DB update
    end note
